### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Register Player
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "player2@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "player"
}

### Register Coach
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coach2@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "coach"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "player1@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Current User (replace TOKEN with actual token from login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIyMmU5ODRhNy1lZTNlLTRjYTgtOTUwNS1hOTRjZGEwZWNlZDciLCJyb2xlIjoicGxheWVyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzYzNDQ0NTQ2LCJleHAiOjE3NjQwNDkzNDZ9.V4hrb9qNVFGUJUZXOllHZ-KW6fSh0LNockpPV7sZj90

